// About page (was the prototype about-sky.astro) — in the home page's voice (night sky, thin serif, restraint). Started 10/8 with the author.
// Reader (CCN): NEW — someone who landed on an article or asked a search engine who this person is.
//   His questions: who is this, on what grounds, what has it to do with me. After reading: read a chosen article, or subscribe.
//   So the page answers first, proves second, tells the story third. (Casual readers are served by the workshop page; core → Confluence.)
// Planned sections: 1 opening (who / what) · 2 the facts (on what grounds) · 3 the story (short, in prose — no timeline,
//   the home page has one) · 4 what he believes · 5 ending: where to start reading + small ways out
// The previous about page is in git history (src/pages/zh-TW/about.astro before the redesign).
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// The ending's four ways out, one per kind of reader. Left labels are Claude's draft (10/9).
const ways = [
  { k: '想先讀幾篇', t: '看文章', href: '/zh-TW/blog/', ev: 'about_click_articles' },
  { k: '想讓新的文章寄給你', t: '訂閱電子報', href: '/zh-TW/#newsletter-form', ev: 'about_click_subscribe' },
  { k: '個人想學這套做法', t: '一日的公開班', href: '/zh-TW/workshop/', ev: 'about_click_workshop' },
  { k: '公司要導入 AI', t: '到匯流顧問找我們', href: 'https://confluence-partners.ai/?utm_source=yu-wenhao.com&utm_medium=about', ev: 'about_click_confluence', out: true },
];

// 10/9: moved here from about-sky.astro — this is now the about page of the branch. Title and description approved by the author on 10/9.
const title = '關於余文皓｜企業 AI 導入顧問、AI 講師';
const description = '科技業二十年，Nokia、聯詠科技、友達光電，做過工程師、PM、事業單位主管的幕僚。現在是企業 AI 導入顧問、AI 講師，Claude 認證架構師，匯流顧問創辦人。';
