        <p class="kick"><i></i>我的故事</p>
        <h2>這條路我走過</h2>
        <div class="st-tx">
          {/* 10/9: the whole story re-run in one pass after reading it top to bottom with the author. What changed and why:
                · roles are introduced once (first paragraph); later paragraphs use them without listing them again
                · 2025: 「我離開公司」 is said — without it the reader could not tell how study turned into full-time building
                · one origin for his way of working: the twenty years are the base, chasing tools is the wrong turn, the order reversed is how they met
